prose <<'MD'
| | | adds |
|---|---|---|
| 1-4 | `traffic-light`, `timer`, `retry`, `login` | the four core machines, compiled by kotlinc against `core` alone where they can be |
| 5 | `suspend` | a suspending machine and `SuspendDriver`, with no coroutine library |
